    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey my bosch dishwasher is showing an e15 error code on the display. i checked the manual but i'm not really sure what to do next. how do i check the leak sensor and actually dry out the base?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "An E15 error on your Bosch dishwasher usually points to a leak detection issue, which is probably what's causing the sensor to trip. You'll need to inspect the area around the dishwasher for any signs of moisture, like a puddle under the unit. To dry out the base, you can pull the dishwasher out from under the counter and use towels or a shop vac to thoroughly dry the floor and the underside of the appliance. If the leak persists after drying, the leak sensor itself might be the culprit, or there could be a hose connection that's loose.",
